{"id":76,"name":"الانسان","transliteration":"Al-Insan","translation_fr":"L'homme","translation_en":"The Man","type":"medinan","total_verses":31,"verses":[{"id":1,"text":"هَلۡ أَتَىٰ عَلَى ٱلۡإِنسَٰنِ حِينٞ مِّنَ ٱلدَّهۡرِ لَمۡ يَكُن شَيۡـٔٗا مَّذۡكُورًا","translation_fr":"S'est-il écoulé pour l'homme un laps de temps durant lequel il n'était même pas une chose mentionnable","translation_en":"Has there [not] come upon man a period of time when he was not a thing [even] mentioned","transliteration":"Hal ata AAala alinsani heenun mina alddahri lam yakun shayan mathkooran"},{"id":2,"text":"إِنَّا خَلَقۡنَا ٱلۡإِنسَٰنَ مِن نُّطۡفَةٍ أَمۡشَاجٖ نَّبۡتَلِيهِ فَجَعَلۡنَٰهُ سَمِيعَۢا بَصِيرًا","translation_fr":"En effet, Nous avons créé l'homme d'une goutte de sperme mélangé [aux composantes diverses] pour le mettre à l'épreuve. [C'est pourquoi] Nous l'avons fait entendant et voyant","translation_en":"Indeed, We created man from a sperm-drop mixture that We may try him; and We made him hearing and seeing","transliteration":"Inna khalaqna alinsana min nutfatin amshajin nabtaleehi fajaAAalnahu sameeAAan baseeran"},{"id":3,"text":"إِنَّا هَدَيۡنَٰهُ ٱلسَّبِيلَ إِمَّا شَاكِرٗا وَإِمَّا كَفُورًا","translation_fr":"Nous l'avons guidé dans le chemin, - qu'il soit reconnaissant ou ingrat","translation_en":"Indeed, We guided him to the way, be he grateful or be he ungrateful","transliteration":"Inna hadaynahu alssabeela imma shakiran waimma kafooran"},{"id":4,"text":"إِنَّآ أَعۡتَدۡنَا لِلۡكَٰفِرِينَ سَلَٰسِلَاْ وَأَغۡلَٰلٗا وَسَعِيرًا","translation_fr":"Nous avons préparé pour les infidèles des chaînes, des carcans et une fournaise ardente","translation_en":"Indeed, We have prepared for the disbelievers chains and shackles and a blaze","transliteration":"Inna aAAtadna lilkafireena salasila waaghlalan wasaAAeeran"},{"id":5,"text":"إِنَّ ٱلۡأَبۡرَارَ يَشۡرَبُونَ مِن كَأۡسٖ كَانَ مِزَاجُهَا كَافُورًا","translation_fr":"Les vertueux boiront d'une coupe dont le mélange sera de camphre","translation_en":"Indeed, the righteous will drink from a cup [of wine] whose mixture is of Kafur","transliteration":"Inna alabrara yashraboona min kasin kana mizajuha kafooran"},{"id":6,"text":"عَيۡنٗا يَشۡرَبُ بِهَا عِبَادُ ٱللَّهِ يُفَجِّرُونَهَا تَفۡجِيرٗا","translation_fr":"d'une source de laquelle boiront les serviteurs d'Allah et ils la feront jaillir en abondance","translation_en":"A spring of which the [righteous] servants of Allah will drink; they will make it gush forth in force [and abundance]","transliteration":"AAaynan yashrabu biha AAibadu Allahi yufajjiroonaha tafjeeran"},{"id":7,"text":"يُوفُونَ بِٱلنَّذۡرِ وَيَخَافُونَ يَوۡمٗا كَانَ شَرُّهُۥ مُسۡتَطِيرٗا","translation_fr":"Ils accomplissent leurs vœux et ils redoutent un jour dont le mal s'étendra partout","translation_en":"They [are those who] fulfill [their] vows and fear a Day whose evil will be widespread","transliteration":"Yoofoona bialnnathri wayakhafoona yawman kana sharruhu mustateeran"},{"id":8,"text":"وَيُطۡعِمُونَ ٱلطَّعَامَ عَلَىٰ حُبِّهِۦ مِسۡكِينٗا وَيَتِيمٗا وَأَسِيرًا","translation_fr":"et offrent la nourriture, malgré son amour, au pauvre, à l'orphelin et au prisonnier","translation_en":"And they give food in spite of love for it to the needy, the orphan, and the captive","transliteration":"WayutAAimona alttaAAama AAala hubbihi miskeenan wayateeman waaseeran"},{"id":9,"text":"إِنَّمَا نُطۡعِمُكُمۡ لِوَجۡهِ ٱللَّهِ لَا نُرِيدُ مِنكُمۡ جَزَآءٗ وَلَا شُكُورًا","translation_fr":"(disant): «C'est pour le visage d'Allah que nous vous nourrissons: nous ne voulons de vous ni récompense ni gratitude","translation_en":"[Saying], \"We feed you only for the countenance of Allah. We wish not from you reward or gratitude","transliteration":"Innama nutAAimukum liwajhi Allahi la nureedu minkum jazaan wala shukooran"},{"id":10,"text":"إِنَّا نَخَافُ مِن رَّبِّنَا يَوۡمًا عَبُوسٗا قَمۡطَرِيرٗا","translation_fr":"Nous redoutons, de notre Seigneur, un jour terrible et catastrophique»","translation_en":"Indeed, We fear from our Lord a Day austere and distressful","transliteration":"Inna nakhafu min rabbina yawman AAaboosan qamtareeran"},{"id":11,"text":"فَوَقَىٰهُمُ ٱللَّهُ شَرَّ ذَٰلِكَ ٱلۡيَوۡمِ وَلَقَّىٰهُمۡ نَضۡرَةٗ وَسُرُورٗا","translation_fr":"Allah les protègera donc du mal de ce jour-là, et leur fera rencontrer la splendeur et la joie","translation_en":"So Allah will protect them from the evil of that Day and give them radiance and happiness","transliteration":"Fawaqahumu Allahu sharra thalika alyawmi walaqqahum nadratan wasurooran"},{"id":12,"text":"وَجَزَىٰهُم بِمَا صَبَرُواْ جَنَّةٗ وَحَرِيرٗا","translation_fr":"et les rétribuera pour ce qu'ils auront enduré, en leur donnant le Paradis et des [vêtements] de soie","translation_en":"And will reward them for what they patiently endured [with] a garden [in Paradise] and silk [garments]","transliteration":"Wajazahum bima sabaroo jannatan wahareeran"},{"id":13,"text":"مُّتَّكِـِٔينَ فِيهَا عَلَى ٱلۡأَرَآئِكِۖ لَا يَرَوۡنَ فِيهَا شَمۡسٗا وَلَا زَمۡهَرِيرٗا","translation_fr":"ils y seront accoudés sur des divans, n'y voyant ni soleil ni froid glacial","translation_en":"[They will be] reclining therein on adorned couches. They will not see therein any [burning] sun or [freezing] cold","transliteration":"Muttakieena feeha AAala alaraiki la yarawna feeha shamsan wala zamhareeran"},{"id":14,"text":"وَدَانِيَةً عَلَيۡهِمۡ ظِلَٰلُهَا وَذُلِّلَتۡ قُطُوفُهَا تَذۡلِيلٗا","translation_fr":"Ses ombrages les couvriront de près, et ses fruits inclinés bien bas [à portée de leurs mains]","translation_en":"And near above them are its shades, and its [fruit] to be picked will be lowered in compliance","transliteration":"Wadaniyatan AAalayhim thilaluha wathullilat qutoofuha tathleelan"},{"id":15,"text":"وَيُطَافُ عَلَيۡهِم بِـَٔانِيَةٖ مِّن فِضَّةٖ وَأَكۡوَابٖ كَانَتۡ قَوَارِيرَا۠","translation_fr":"Et l'on fera circuler parmi eux des récipients d'argent et des coupes cristallines","translation_en":"And there will be circulated among them vessels of silver and cups having been [created] clear [as glass]","transliteration":"Wayutafu AAalayhim bianiyatin min fiddatin waakwabin kanat qawareera"},{"id":16,"text":"قَوَارِيرَاْ مِن فِضَّةٖ قَدَّرُوهَا تَقۡدِيرٗا","translation_fr":"en cristal d'argent, dont le contenu a été savamment dosé","translation_en":"Clear glasses [made] from silver of which they have determined the measure","transliteration":"Qawareera min fiddatin qaddarooha taqdeeran"},{"id":17,"text":"وَيُسۡقَوۡنَ فِيهَا كَأۡسٗا كَانَ مِزَاجُهَا زَنجَبِيلًا","translation_fr":"Et là, ils seront abreuvés d'une coupe dont le mélange sera de gingembre","translation_en":"And they will be given to drink a cup [of wine] whose mixture is of ginger","transliteration":"Wayusqawna feeha kasan kana mizajuha zanjabeelan"},{"id":18,"text":"عَيۡنٗا فِيهَا تُسَمَّىٰ سَلۡسَبِيلٗا","translation_fr":"puisé là-dedans à une source qui s'appelle Salsabîl","translation_en":"[From] a fountain within Paradise named Salsabeel","transliteration":"AAaynan feeha tusamma salsabeelan"},{"id":19,"text":"۞وَيَطُوفُ عَلَيۡهِمۡ وِلۡدَٰنٞ مُّخَلَّدُونَ إِذَا رَأَيۡتَهُمۡ حَسِبۡتَهُمۡ لُؤۡلُؤٗا مَّنثُورٗا","translation_fr":"Et parmi eux, circuleront des garçons éternellement jeunes. Quand tu les verras, tu les prendras pour des perles éparpillées","translation_en":"There will circulate among them young boys made eternal. When you see them, you would think them [as beautiful as] scattered pearls","transliteration":"Wayatoofu AAalayhim wildanun mukhalladoona itha raaytahum hasibtahum luluan manthooran"},{"id":20,"text":"وَإِذَا رَأَيۡتَ ثَمَّ رَأَيۡتَ نَعِيمٗا وَمُلۡكٗا كَبِيرًا","translation_fr":"Et quand tu regarderas là-bas, tu verras un délice et un vaste royaume","translation_en":"And when you look there [in Paradise], you will see pleasure and great dominion","transliteration":"Waitha raayta thamma raayta naAAeeman wamulkan kabeeran"},{"id":21,"text":"عَٰلِيَهُمۡ ثِيَابُ سُندُسٍ خُضۡرٞ وَإِسۡتَبۡرَقٞۖ وَحُلُّوٓاْ أَسَاوِرَ مِن فِضَّةٖ وَسَقَىٰهُمۡ رَبُّهُمۡ شَرَابٗا طَهُورًا","translation_fr":"Ils porteront des vêtements verts de satin et de brocart. Et ils seront parés de bracelets d'argent. Et leur Seigneur les abreuvera d'une boisson très pure","translation_en":"Upon the inhabitants will be green garments of fine silk and brocade. And they will be adorned with bracelets of silver, and their Lord will give them a purifying drink","transliteration":"AAaliyahum thiyabu sundusin khudrun waistabraqun wahulloo asawira min fiddatin wasaqahum rabbuhum sharaban tahooran"},{"id":22,"text":"إِنَّ هَٰذَا كَانَ لَكُمۡ جَزَآءٗ وَكَانَ سَعۡيُكُم مَّشۡكُورًا","translation_fr":"Cela sera pour vous une récompense, et votre effort sera reconnu","translation_en":"[And it will be said], \"Indeed, this is for you a reward, and your effort has been appreciated","transliteration":"Inna hatha kana lakum jazaan wakana saAAyukum mashkooran"},{"id":23,"text":"إِنَّا نَحۡنُ نَزَّلۡنَا عَلَيۡكَ ٱلۡقُرۡءَانَ تَنزِيلٗا","translation_fr":"En vérité c'est Nous qui avons fait descendre sur toi le Coran graduellement","translation_en":"Indeed, it is We who have sent down to you, [O Muhammad], the Qur'an progressively","transliteration":"Inna nahnu nazzalna AAalayka alqurana tanzeelan"},{"id":24,"text":"فَٱصۡبِرۡ لِحُكۡمِ رَبِّكَ وَلَا تُطِعۡ مِنۡهُمۡ ءَاثِمًا أَوۡ كَفُورٗا","translation_fr":"Endure donc ce que ton Seigneur a décrété, et n'obéis ni au pécheur, parmi eux, ni au grand mécréant","translation_en":"So be patient for the decision of your Lord and do not obey from among them a sinner or ungrateful [disbeliever]","transliteration":"Faisbir lihukmi rabbika wala tutiAA minhum athiman aw kafooran"},{"id":25,"text":"وَٱذۡكُرِ ٱسۡمَ رَبِّكَ بُكۡرَةٗ وَأَصِيلٗا","translation_fr":"Et invoque le nom de ton Seigneur, matin et après-midi","translation_en":"And mention the name of your Lord [in prayer] morning and evening","transliteration":"Waothkuri isma rabbika bukratan waaseelan"},{"id":26,"text":"وَمِنَ ٱلَّيۡلِ فَٱسۡجُدۡ لَهُۥ وَسَبِّحۡهُ لَيۡلٗا طَوِيلًا","translation_fr":"et prosterne-toi devant Lui une partie de la nuit; et glorifie-Le de longues [heures] pendant la nuit","translation_en":"And during the night prostrate to Him and exalt Him a long [part of the] night","transliteration":"Wamina allayli faosjud lahu wasabbihhu laylan taweelan"},{"id":27,"text":"إِنَّ هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ يُحِبُّونَ ٱلۡعَاجِلَةَ وَيَذَرُونَ وَرَآءَهُمۡ يَوۡمٗا ثَقِيلٗا","translation_fr":"Ces gens-là aiment [la vie] éphémère (la vie sur terre) et laissent derrière eux un jour bien lourd [le Jour du Jugement]","translation_en":"Indeed, these [disbelievers] love the immediate and leave behind them a grave Day","transliteration":"Inna haolai yuhibboona alAAajilata wayatharoona waraahum yawman thaqeelan"},{"id":28,"text":"نَّحۡنُ خَلَقۡنَٰهُمۡ وَشَدَدۡنَآ أَسۡرَهُمۡۖ وَإِذَا شِئۡنَا بَدَّلۡنَآ أَمۡثَٰلَهُمۡ تَبۡدِيلًا","translation_fr":"C'est Nous qui les avons créés et avons fortifié leur constitution. Quand Nous voulons, cependant, Nous les remplaçons [facilement] par leurs semblables","translation_en":"We have created them and strengthened their forms, and when We will, We can change their likenesses with [complete] alteration","transliteration":"Nahnu khalaqnahum washadadna asrahum waitha shina baddalna amthalahum tabdeelan"},{"id":29,"text":"إِنَّ هَٰذِهِۦ تَذۡكِرَةٞۖ فَمَن شَآءَ ٱتَّخَذَ إِلَىٰ رَبِّهِۦ سَبِيلٗا","translation_fr":"Ceci est un rappel. Que celui qui veut prenne donc le chemin vers son Seigneur","translation_en":"Indeed, this is a reminder, so he who wills may take to his Lord a way","transliteration":"Inna hathihi tathkiratun faman shaa ittakhatha ila rabbihi sabeelan"},{"id":30,"text":"وَمَا تَشَآءُونَ إِلَّآ أَن يَشَآءَ ٱللَّهُۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ كَانَ عَلِيمًا حَكِيمٗا","translation_fr":"Cependant, vous ne saurez vouloir, à moins qu'Allah veuille. Et Allah est Omniscient et Sage","translation_en":"And you do not will except that Allah wills. Indeed, Allah is ever Knowing and Wise","transliteration":"Wama tashaoona illa an yashaa Allahu inna Allaha kana AAaleeman hakeeman"},{"id":31,"text":"يُدۡخِلُ مَن يَشَآءُ فِي رَحۡمَتِهِۦۚ وَٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ أَعَدَّ لَهُمۡ عَذَابًا أَلِيمَۢا","translation_fr":"Il fait entrer qui Il veut dans Sa miséricorde. Et quant aux injustes, Il leur a préparé un châtiment douloureux","translation_en":"He admits whom He wills into His mercy; but the wrongdoers - He has prepared for them a painful punishment","transliteration":"Yudkhilu man yashao fee rahmatihi waalththalimeena aAAadda lahum AAathaban aleeman"}]}